utu.be/s9WWfCMLf2U\n▷https://youtu.be/68xnSKzee-k", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Ha1uday0/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1906924556050460672%2FSHETf7Vo.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9dc34d07e283a7f5e2ab94c48887f3a8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1906924556050460672%2FSHETf7Vo.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9dc34d07e283a7f5e2ab94c48887f3a8, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1906924556050460672%2FSHETf7Vo.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=124d2f5f87e6523fec49aba9a95575c7 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1906924556050460672%2FSHETf7Vo.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a209fbcf08668c11ebedf6d6ac1c2880 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "あなたの音楽が大好きです。\n\n私のキャラクターのテーマソングを作っていただけませんか？特に要望はないのですが、思いついたものを自由に作曲してください！中国や日本の伝統的な楽器が混ざっていてもいいかもしれません。\n\nありがとうございます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/1xcCCGs3jCfo4k354cQuVY6rj0Kx2ndRp", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Ha1uday0/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1906924556050460672%2FSHETf7Vo.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9dc34d07e283a7f5e2ab94c48887f3a8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1906924556050460672%2FSHETf7Vo.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9dc34d07e283a7f5e2ab94c48887f3a8, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1906924556050460672%2FSHETf7Vo.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=124d2f5f87e6523fec49aba9a95575c7 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1906924556050460672%2FSHETf7Vo.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a209fbcf08668c11ebedf6d6ac1c2880 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! My name is Momoka.exe, and I would love a new BGM for when I start my streams! My character is an A.I. girl that wears a mask, and loves to play games and have fun with her chat! I love music that is upbeat and fun to listen to, with electronic sounds that keep the rhythm going and feel super fun to listen to on repeat!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/ergzpOE\n\nHere are some examples of what I am looking for! I love the artist, and I hope you can use their music as inspiration to come up with a song that brings just as much excitement! If there is a way to bring in vocals similar to how the examples do, I would love that!\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kffFExCiMC0\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VMcV2DhVpGg&list=RDkffFExCiMC0&index=3\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TNeatjG_nUw&list=RDkffFExCiMC0&index=5\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0UhntYbh9mY&list=RDkffFExCiMC0&index=8\n\nI can't wait to hear what you create!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}